WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:18.570
Everywhere Roxy looked she saw blobs.

2
00:00:18.571 --> 00:00:20.154
They oozed on buildings.

3
00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:22.932
They covered cars.

4
00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:25.922
"This is terrible!" thought Roxy.

5
00:00:25.923 --> 00:00:29.995
A helicopter flew over Mara.

6
00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.773
One small blob jumped toward it.

7
00:00:32.774 --> 00:00:37.515
But the blob froze and fell to the rooftop.

8
00:00:37.516 --> 00:00:39.848
"Wow!" said Mara.

9
00:00:39.849 --> 00:00:46.595
"I think the cold breeze from the helicopter froze that blob!"

10
00:00:46.596 --> 00:00:49.255
Mara looked at Roxy.

11
00:00:49.256 --> 00:00:51.803
"Rocket Girl!" she called.

12
00:00:51.804 --> 00:00:54.219
"Use your super breath!

13
00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:57.217
It will freeze the blobs!"

14
00:00:57.218 --> 00:01:00.074
"I'll try it!" Roxy called back.

15
00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:03.895
Roxy took a deep breath. Whoosh!!

16
00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:07.746
Three blobs on a billboard froze and fell to the street.

17
00:01:07.747 --> 00:01:10.238
"Yes!" Roxy cheered.

18
00:01:10.239 --> 00:01:12.946
She took a deeper breath and blew again.

19
00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:17.202
Whoo-ooo-oosh! More blobs froze.

20
00:01:17.203 --> 00:01:22.761
Soon every blob was frozen solid.

21
00:01:22.762 --> 00:01:26.014
Mrs. Wiggles was in her candy factory.

22
00:01:26.015 --> 00:01:30.165
"Soon I'll call Mayor Bloom," she said.

23
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:35.912
"I'll tell him to pay me one million dollars!"

24
00:01:35.913 --> 00:01:40.801
Mrs. Wiggles peered through a telescope at downtown Metro City.

25
00:01:40.802 --> 00:01:43.960
"Oh no!" she cried.

26
00:01:43.961 --> 00:01:47.430
"Where did my bubble gum blob go?"

27
00:01:47.431 --> 00:01:51.150
Just then Roxy crashed into the candy factory.

28
00:01:51.151 --> 00:01:54.910
"Rocket Girl!" said Mrs. Wiggles.

29
00:01:54.911 --> 00:01:58.655
"I stopped your bubble gum blob!" said Roxy.

30
00:01:58.656 --> 00:02:01.671
"And now you're going to jail!"

31
00:02:01.672 --> 00:02:04.429
Mrs. Wiggles snapped her fingers.

32
00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.648
Several large gingerbread men ran into the room.

33
00:02:07.649 --> 00:02:11.305
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

34
00:02:11.306 --> 00:02:14.573
"You'll never take me to jail!"

35
00:02:14.574 --> 00:02:17.068
Roxy looked at the gingerbread men.

36
00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.773
They were big and mean looking.

37
00:02:19.774 --> 00:02:22.465
"I'll be right back," said Roxy.

38
00:02:22.466 --> 00:02:24.803
"I forgot something."

39
00:02:24.804 --> 00:02:27.270
Roxy flew out of the building.

40
00:02:27.271 --> 00:02:29.599
Mrs. Wiggles laughed.

41
00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.350
"Rocket Girl is scared of—"

42
00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:36.823
Splat! A small blob hit a gingerbread man.

43
00:02:36.824 --> 00:02:40.396
The gingerbread man smashed into pieces.

44
00:02:40.397 --> 00:02:44.122
"What's going on?" Mrs. Wiggles cried.

45
00:02:44.123 --> 00:02:48.073
Splat! Splat! Splat!

46
00:02:48.074 --> 00:02:52.919
Roxy threw blobs at every gingerbread man.

47
00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.125
Soon all the gingerbread men were smashed.

48
00:02:56.126 --> 00:03:00.215
"No!" cried Mrs. Wiggles.

49
00:03:00.216 --> 00:03:03.884
Roxy took Mrs. Wiggles to jail.

50
00:03:03.885 --> 00:03:06.792
Then she flew back to Mara.

51
00:03:06.793 --> 00:03:09.732
"Thanks for your help," said Roxy.

52
00:03:09.733 --> 00:03:13.388
"My friends are at Metro City Park," said Mara.

53
00:03:13.389 --> 00:03:15.308
"Can you take me there?"

54
00:03:15.309 --> 00:03:22.269
Roxy smiled. "Sure. Rocket Girl can do that!"

55
00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:26.331
A little while later, Roxy was out of her Rocket Girl costume.

56
00:03:26.332 --> 00:03:30.207
She found her friends at the park.

57
00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:34.575
"Hey, Roxy!" called Terrell."Mara is here!

58
00:03:34.576 --> 00:03:36.591
Guess who found her."

59
00:03:36.592 --> 00:03:39.001
"Who?" asked Roxy.

60
00:03:39.002 --> 00:03:41.399
"Rocket Girl!" said Mara.

61
00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:45.376
"She saved me from a giant bubble gum blob!"

62
00:03:45.377 --> 00:03:48.218
"Wow," said Roxy.

63
00:03:48.219 --> 00:03:52.236
"I can't believe I missed Rocket Girl."

64
00:03:52.237 --> 00:03:55.304
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

65
00:03:55.305 --> 00:04:02.286
"Let's play kickball!" said Jack.

66
00:04:02.287 --> 00:04:10.822
Roxy and her friends ran onto the field.
